---
description: nipoto-ai service rules (principles, module boundaries, tests)
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `CLAUDE.md` first; it is the single source for these rules. Summary:

- Design doc: `AI-SERVICE.fa.md` (§n). Plan and tasks: `MVP-PLAN.fa.md` (T<m>.<n>, D<n>).
- Implement one task at a time; stay inside its "files" list; `make lint test` must be green;
  check every acceptance criterion at the end.
- AI-1..AI-7 are mandatory. In particular:
  - only `app/connectors/` calls the main backend;
  - `app/pipeline/` never names a provider/model, it uses routes from `config/routes.yaml`;
  - `search(query, actor)` always applies the visibility filter, derived from the actor role;
  - `user_id` only from `Actor` (verified JWT), never from body or model output.
- Normalize Persian text on both ingest and query with `app/retrieval/normalize.py`.
- Prompt changes = new versioned file; never edit a released prompt.
- Unit tests: no network; use FakeLLM / FakeEmbedder / FakeMainBackend; respx for HTTP.
